{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05366","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 李元紘","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"硕儒延凤沼，金马被鸿私。\n馔玉趋丹禁，牋花降紫墀。\n衔恩倾旨酒，鼓舞咏康时。\n暂觏羣书缉，逾昭盛业丕。\n接筵欣有命，搦管媿无词。\n自惊一何幸，太阳还及葵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李元紘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}